{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411080","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1341108001:0":{"text":"Lorsan, how did you end up working here?","source_cn":"洛桑，你怎么会跑到这里来打工呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC9F844617568850","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341108002:1":{"text":"It's a long story...","source_cn":"啊，这件事有点复杂，说来话长……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26AC1CB5524FBC03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1341108002":{"text":"It's a long story...","source_cn":"啊，这件事有点复杂，说来话长……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26AC1CB5524FBC03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341108003:0":{"text":"Alright. As you know, I've been traveling around since I left the Dark Forest.","source_cn":"好吧，你们也知道，我离开薄暮丛林以后就一直在到处游历，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x374A8B33523B3136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341108004:0":{"text":"About two months ago, I set off from Savannah, the capital of the Lightbearer Empire, for the famous Serene Lyceum.","source_cn":"大概两个多月前，我从耀光帝国的首都赛凡纳启程，打算接下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB91274C35EED718","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1341108005:0":{"text":"At the wayrest, I boarded a gorgeous carriage. It was sky-blue, adorned with golden and silver drawings of white-tailed sparrows and sunflowers, and pulled by four robust brown horses!","source_cn":"呃，我在驿站上了一辆外观很符合我审美的马车——天蓝色，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36E3606B0FB6A761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1341108006:0":{"text":"Everything was great except... *cough* I was supposed to take another carriage with only two horses.","source_cn":"一切都很好，除了……咳，我原本计划乘坐的驶往莱希拉姆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDD31713397C0644","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1341108007:0":{"text":"Huh? You mean...","source_cn":"啊？你的意思是说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6388968A3B0315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1341108007":{"text":"Huh? You mean...","source_cn":"啊？你的意思是说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6388968A3B0315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1341108008:1":{"text":"Yes... It was a tiny blunder on my part...","source_cn":"是的，是的……呃，我犯了一个小小的错误……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15DDE89A1314F3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1341108010:0":{"text":"What a journey... But that still doesn't explain why you're working here.","source_cn":"还真是随意呢……你就这么到白山公国来了？可是，这和你在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CF0CA4AF6AB39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1341108011:0":{"text":"You see, I could only afford the trip to the Serene Lyceum. My plan was to perform at a tavern to support myself once I got there.","source_cn":"其实我口袋里的钱币只够付到莱希拉姆的车费。我本来打算到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A8C3C35E66D6BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1341108012:0":{"text":"But Whiteridge is much farther than the Lyceum... I couldn't pay for the carriage, let alone food and lodging.","source_cn":"但白山可比莱希拉姆远多了……这下可好，我口袋里那点钱连...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45FDE2970AFB446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1341108013:1":{"text":"Luckily, I ran into the generous and kind-hearted Madam Gerda. She covered my fare and asked if I'd be willing to work at her inn, as she needed help preparing for the upcoming festival.","source_cn":"还好我运气不错，在雪松镇遇见了豪爽又热心的格尔达女士。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F2544667084FFE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1341108014:1":{"text":"Anyway, fate has brought us together again, my friends!","source_cn":"所以，结局就是——亲爱的朋友们，我们又在这里碰面了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65EC8A913D670C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"You took the wrong carriage?!","source_cn":"你坐错马车了？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3ABED5427E27840C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You took the wrong carriage?!","female":"You took the wrong carriage?!","variant_male_record_index":"69704","variant_female_record_index":"69705","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1341108009:1":{"text":"Actually, it didn't hit me until three days later...","source_cn":"实际上，马车跑了三天以后我才发现我坐错了车……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1969E871B2F6A365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"You only realized your mistake after getting in?!","source_cn":"你上车了才发现不对？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD77D43A0AA1EA7D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You only realized your mistake after getting in?!","female":"You only realized your mistake after getting in?!","variant_male_record_index":"69706","variant_female_record_index":"69707","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl